      "message": "Looks like we turn on all S3 rail before start turn on S0 rail, This significantly violated SOC boot sequence. \n\nFor example: PP900_DDRPLL need to be turn on after CENTER_LOGIC, but before we can do LPDDR_PWR_EN. Now it is after LPDDR_EN which will means DRAM is not booting up.   \n\n\nCan we restructure the sequence code not by power state, but just a boot up sequence + a power down sequence.",
